{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "0231d5d3d17ecddb3491d9c4f1cffb014f789d8fb13f7853ba52d94920a6507e", "ja": "あべこべのMarionette", "zh": "颠倒的Marionette", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "84a4473c930e4a9abca8454a267aaa8c1729452a4294e3a69d926fbd859b0f7e", "ja": "目が覚めるとアイドル達は、人形の姿に\n変わっていた。現状を打破するために結束\nするが、女主人にパフォーマンスすることを\n強要される。意志に反して、勝手に動く体。\n人形になったアイドル達を操る正体は……。", "zh": "偶像们一觉醒来，变成了人偶的模样。为了打破现状而团结起来，却被女主人强迫进行表演。违背自身意志，身体却擅自行动。操纵着变成人偶的偶像们的真身是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "4a9a8ff0b0c48986b1fb1dde37beab8160753d11fdc0e92b66f9906abe278f4b", "ja": "…………。\nはっ。ここは、さっきの部屋……？", "zh": "…………\n\n啊，这里是刚才的房间……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "f9c6870c367cfec90794b175780d875b1f6a39ebb03badfe34367a3ded726576", "ja": "服が……なぜ、衣装に着替えているのでしょうか。\nそれに、この部屋……。", "zh": "衣服……为何，我已经换上了演出服呢。\n还有，这个房间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "6058e35ad87a23fdcd3559f5e9eaad76777deedb2c84b3a888e983a418b75397", "ja": "壊れた人形が、いくつも置いてあります。\nこんなもの、さっきまでなかったはず……。", "zh": "房间里摆着好几个坏掉的人偶。\n这些东西，刚才应该还没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "0150db124f8ae1db71d3d195821345251e4123f11b1aac1c9481462b20a5e6bb", "ja": "もぐもぐ……デリシャスです……\nもぐもぐ……デリシャスです……。", "zh": "嚼嚼……真delicious……\n嚼嚼……真delicious……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "2caf42e29052690af1d58b51f5b63dbc00f0efe7e888d814ccac4b7bed5b2017", "ja": "ロコ～。なぁ、そろそろ目を覚ましてくれよ。\nそれとも、本当に人形になっちゃったのか？", "zh": "ROCO～。喂，差不多该醒醒了吧。\n还是说，你真的变成人偶了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "f37f839092d91a7762145e6c54779e6affe1840def714716cdb3210bb0e772e2", "ja": "もぐもぐ……デリシャスです……\n……はっ！　グッドモーニングです、スバル！", "zh": "嚼嚼……真美味……\n……啊！早上好，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "b13ca72c15d0a858285feaa87acb63220276e61335e3ed51e65783840d4e49f5", "ja": "やっと返事した！　てか、本物のロコだよな？\nいまいち、見分けがつかないんだよな～。", "zh": "终于回应了！话说，你真的是货真价实的ROCO吧？\n我总觉得不太能分辨出来啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d0444ee57b902109e4bb15feae35eea4e3ce8436d3fa8d706105c4816364ccd", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……杏奈ちゃん、起きて。", "zh": "杏奈……杏奈，醒醒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "729a889e71fbcbe494837badd564989aba84ba4644cf48ef15e30844eb5316a3", "ja": "……ん……百合子、さん……？\n……あれ？　ここ、どこ……。", "zh": "……嗯……百合子、姐……？\n……咦？这里，是哪里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "dbc2836b71d80d1c4941acb83f55262b298a59986c4c08e2f53db1b985d18f71", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……みんなも、落ち着いて聞いてね。\n私たち、球体関節人形になっちゃってるみたい。", "zh": "杏奈……大家也冷静下来听我说。\n我们好像变成球形关节人偶了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "767a98535ae3c0b3f05451bde61652490c61335a71eef7278d8ecb1cc10bf3cf", "ja": "え？　……ほ、本当です！\nロコたち、ドールになってます！", "zh": "诶？……真、真的！\nROCO她们变成玩偶了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "b34493f494cd36d5ea05c49793243af098a482726137d3776f771c9eb3dc593f", "ja": "な、何これ……なんで？\nどうして杏奈たち、人形になっちゃってるの！？", "zh": "这、这是什么……为什么？\n为什么杏奈她们变成人偶了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "6cdcfeb892df7222157fefca1279173f7e1e9758dc9f9cedaaa94d29f47e5973", "ja": "服で見えないけど、人形の体になってて……。\n体温も感じられないし、動かすとカタカタ音が鳴るの。", "zh": "衣服挡着看不出来，但身体已经变成人偶的了……。\n感觉不到体温，动一动还会发出咔哒咔哒的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "9764029a82c3a22b784cb571750b6ee0e9cb4c7a1263dc92dec8d7bd76e5a77f", "ja": "私たち、ずっとここに閉じ込められちゃうのかな。\nおばあちゃんになるまで……。", "zh": "我们会不会就这样一直被困在这里啊。\n直到变成老奶奶……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "0aa498bc8857316822e87dd6f456e73678537d52ccc298fa1e106db8e59695ad", "ja": "七尾さん！", "zh": "七尾小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "eaeef4af68f686e0b6e982fbcd4eb0957f76b38ab4800d36d4025b2f1fd89dbd", "ja": "……瑞希さん。", "zh": "……瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "3656d7de3ccef1e596bd330f216493dbcd6d26137c577e5ded042f0e715e461b", "ja": "落ち着いてください。\n入ってくることができたのだから、出られるはずです。", "zh": "请冷静下来。\n既然能进来，就一定能出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "81ed75cfa2c1ccd07a4ae0746010ef0886f5e0ef906d02b07dc76f40f172937e", "ja": "まずは冷静に、周囲を観察しましょう。\nきっと、外に出る手がかりがあるはずです。", "zh": "首先冷静下来，观察一下周围吧。\n肯定能找到出去的线索。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "d4ba027e451cd2cad79d48d74dbbc592cfe942158975e0ad464b3d2646c8acea", "ja": "あっ……ありがとう、瑞希さん。\n私、取り乱しちゃって……ごめんなさい。", "zh": "啊……谢谢你，瑞希。\n我刚才有点慌乱……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "ce42937f4ba40a4c2e38ce071b7f4753f6f51c1b10299fe483a51d92cfc4c830", "ja": "そうですよ、ユリコ！\nミズキも、不安だったらロコの手を握ってくださいね。", "zh": "没错，百合子！  \n瑞希要是感到不安，也请握住ROCO的手哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "27a13d19ed53ffd1b8a634d259db72de2f6ac5d2539c1fdb40d214d94465d401", "ja": "ロコたちは、ひとりじゃありません。\n5人なら、大丈夫です！", "zh": "ROCO们并不是孤身一人。\n有5个人的话，就没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "c6b51baa592651a511328a3acccff0b8b0f06ad8342492b1e88c2763a66b33e3", "ja": "伴田さん……。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "伴田小姐……  \n谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "4c0c50abe2a0e2fe7d154012487a55fd9fac6b9a58d78194c1f81557bd16a90c", "ja": "さっきは、強気なことを言いましたが。\n本当は、私も手が震えていました。……ブルブル。", "zh": "刚才我说了些逞强的话。\n其实，我的手也在发抖。……瑟瑟发抖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "34a33feebb2a2b49c8ab2b7dadde5671b3cb4d5ab96e3825cc9aef2fe8c96136", "ja": "Chrono-Lexicaの中では、一番の\nお姉さんなのに。……情けないぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "在Chrono-Lexica里面，明明我是最大的\n姐姐。……太没出息了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "be106162b6328ff4d6b345815955e15752df7eee0f0248f32a9c247013018c59", "ja": "仲間なんだから、情けないとかないじゃん？\n大変な時は、みんなで励ましあってこーぜ！", "zh": "既然是伙伴，就没有什么丢不丢人的吧？  \n遇到困难的时候，大家一起互相加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "ddf39729993d67432e6c274677217d164951c7dd23f79b3181210ff95cfda2bb", "ja": "うん。きっとどこかに出口はあるよ。\nまずは、この部屋を探してみよう！", "zh": "嗯。肯定在哪能找到出口的。\n首先，先在这间房间里找找看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1026_se", "source_sha256": "d2d386fa255704e952d4e0cbb60e148a054b4c9ac688c3fc0e5894fdfd55d98f", "ja": "ガタガタガタガタ……", "zh": "咯噔咯噔咯噔咯噔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1027_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "fe3e39d8b95d82b3f25a2259af115b55553dfeb2660bd9f0aea6f3f890223b3d", "ja": "さあ、そろそろティータイムにしましょう♪", "zh": "那么，差不多该喝茶了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "f103419a77046b03cf4143449f8c6449fb62fbf30995f37293799ad1537946ed", "ja": "なんだ？　この音……。\nてか、こんな時に紅茶飲むの？", "zh": "这是什么？这个声音……\n话说，这种时候要喝红茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1029_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "e2bd9dea9811d859c856561d7b8da22b60064d92801d2be9faa0305d60b730d0", "ja": "あなた達は飲めませんよ。\nティーパーティの余興をするのです。", "zh": "你们可不能喝哦。\n你们是要为茶会助兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "80c88bd4f3c655dbbc42f32b1989b5fa8c6d104a843d94364fa1cead8ea648e6", "ja": "余興？\n……うわっ！", "zh": "余兴？\n……呜哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "9eef0e439eca5e360e489fb7d67ae38f56b5b90b314fb93d37a3b09a8302a6b1", "ja": "ど、どこだよここ……。\nてか劇場のステージじゃん？", "zh": "这、这是哪儿啊……  \n话说，这不是剧场的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1032_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "115b884be5bd3ae001a5f48a25f10a8650d0f9c4be24e0c45f8b54f42839961e", "ja": "さあ、可愛い人形達。歌って踊ってごらんなさい。\nお客様が、パフォーマンスを待ち望んでいますわ！", "zh": "来吧，可爱的人偶们。唱唱歌、跳跳舞吧。观众们正翘首以盼你们的表演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96c57babb48bca607fffb2d951c1225cbaaee7cbb82425b3552e84e54adb837", "ja": "な、何言ってるんですか？　私達を閉じ込めて、\nこんな状況でパフォーマンスなんて……！", "zh": "你、你在说什么呀？把我们关起来，在这种情况下还要表演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3152c46272ef61bb716c550b0774e4f34d2c957dc667059e419020dbad4030b", "ja": "そうだそうだー！　……って、あれっ？\n杏奈の体が、勝手に動く！？", "zh": "对对——！……咦，诶？\n杏奈的身体，居然自己动起来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "04bd67f69cd9e33935d3f2cbc0b84821169a7a5455a09b5389b5d4d4871fda36", "ja": "わ～んっ！\n杏奈、操り人形になっちゃったみたい……！？", "zh": "呜哇——！杏奈好像变成提线木偶了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "cb77a1c947811db1c535bf2b7fb3d83f5fd72d5c3cee770f5e93a3706a1fc0da", "ja": "ろ、ロコもです～！　どうやらストリングで、\nマニピュレイテッドされてるみたいです～！", "zh": "路、ROCO也是～！看样子像是被提线给\n操纵（manipulated）住了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "c63a92e1f29adc7293218533da325cbcb5ac938ecdfa74b9088c08f9757795f6", "ja": "誰だよ、オレたちを操ってるのは！", "zh": "到底是谁在操纵我们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "22efef09355281435f4c35a909a14efc1fa02eb042fd6206f4791e3dc0a96892", "ja": "……！　皆さん、いました。私達を操っている人が、\nはるか上空にいます。ですが、あれは……。", "zh": "……！大家，找到了。操控我们的人，\n就在遥远的高空。但是，那个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1039_025roc", "source_sha256": "34c7f7dd68759aebb74bc7e979e2e03c514ed2cc659b1c656c3e50588f1eaa2f", "ja": "ロコを操っているのは……ろ、ロコ！？", "zh": "操纵ROCO的是……呃、ROCO！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "c92c172dfc106e96cf005378c4eef33866a7872c693e60287d2f26ee9910e975", "ja": "ずいぶん大きく見えますが……もしかして、\n小さくなったのは私たち、なのでしょうか。", "zh": "看起来大了好多……难道说，变小的是我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "362844a3986ce77f3aed217a2c369811469c95011ed102ec7ce45fdcff63b1f2", "ja": "大きい杏奈が、杏奈を操ってる……どういうこと？\nだって、杏奈は杏奈だよ！？", "zh": "大杏奈在操控着杏奈……这是怎么回事？\n可杏奈就是杏奈呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "802830726d62bd45ac3a3e8d3c1e4d03c194daa7b005f9b5b8de132dad479ff4", "ja": "で、でも私たち、今は人形になっちゃってるから……。", "zh": "可、可是我们现在已经变成玩偶了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "9db5464d2ae44bd1da5962eaae28ba80f3faa032a472ff41ecbacf0602dfb25e", "ja": "もしかしたら、今私達を操ってる人間の\nChrono-Lexicaのほうが、本物なのかも……。", "zh": "说不定，现在操纵着我们的人类\nChrono-Lexica，才是货真价实的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "62d8d10d0cbb0201136388e969fc275d6c668475a41918d3e008785d1695a5ac", "ja": "そんなことあるわけないだろー！\nオレは本物の永吉昴！　そりゃ、人形だけど……。", "zh": "哪有那种事啊——！\n我可是货真价实的永吉昴！虽然确实是个人偶……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "0993e8f06a16afbe92db42a8c7e752e4f07f4bed7ac9ddc47556bd212a110a38", "ja": "ドールがヒューマンでヒューマンがドールで……。\nううっ、混乱してきました～！！", "zh": "玩偶是人类，人类是玩偶……。\n呜呜，我都开始混乱了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "f3b398984b6820324ef870032d1436866275c0f2cd073cd7f59485797df6c63d", "ja": "ちょっと、そこのアナタ！\n上で杏奈を操ってる、オフモードの杏奈！", "zh": "等一下，那边的你！\n正在操纵上面杏奈的，处于休息模式的杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1047_024ann", "source_sha256": "55da08f2e7ea69a1964b75bbaf4de98d0ed74e927be1c962664473913bfc1e0c", "ja": "人を勝手に操るのはやめなさーい！", "zh": "别再擅自操控别人啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "e4c0a98b019e62bb6e1e8d52ef4b5346afbff3d4edf2ffbf30110955bf37fc89", "ja": "……答えがありません。\n聞こえていないのでしょうか。", "zh": "……没有回答。\n是听不见吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1049_024ann", "source_sha256": "0b146769fdfa0e220b454481d0c2d688302a48b52ffd8d5e117f1497ca6b1ec4", "ja": "諦めない！　杏奈！　杏奈杏奈杏奈杏奈杏奈！！\n杏奈も杏奈なんだったら、返事しなさーい！", "zh": "不能放弃！杏奈！杏奈杏奈杏奈杏奈杏奈！！\n既然杏奈也是杏奈，就回我一声啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1050_024ann", "source_sha256": "2cde1c8daa4557a9c88e1b2fd0b165b9eeb13aa6e5688652f2e97815f310af18", "ja": "……うるさいなあ。", "zh": "……好吵啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "7745f1840f4dd3436a6d27ab9d261a7d59376b5845131e33d4f7478eb18dec25", "ja": "……！　返事がありましたね。", "zh": "……！有回应了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "4b29dfda04ca84a4b5fb38b2438ed76ac88ce9437cc318720a80c43e987ab7ab", "ja": "杏奈、聞こえてるんだよね。\n今すぐみんなを解放して！　劇場に帰ろう！", "zh": "杏奈，你听得见吧。\n现在马上把大家放出来！我们回剧场去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1053_024ann", "source_sha256": "a18f9ebebeaf7dba8eecf7bf01db7b0214022808355fa635f5f1a77565d098ce", "ja": "……そんなに帰りたいなら、ひとりで帰れば。", "zh": "……那么想回去的话，就自己一个人回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_03_1055_024ann", "source_sha256": "6b816df1f267c3d8d5170b389bc98c4c43b4f8175eebbded33c8bc05c78c991b", "ja": "……杏奈はもう、疲れたの。\nこれからは……杏奈が、ひとりでやって。", "zh": "……杏奈已经，累了。\n今后……就由杏奈，自己来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
